# General settings tab (Settings → General).

settings-general-accessibility-title = Accessibility
settings-general-os-reduced-motion-notice = OS Animation Disabled: Your operating system has animations disabled in accessibility settings. UI animations won't appear until you enable them in your system preferences.
settings-general-reduced-motion-label = Reduced Motion
settings-general-reduced-motion-description = Disable UI animations for a faster and cleaner experience.

settings-general-privacy-integration-title = Privacy & Integration
settings-general-telemetry-label = Error Telemetry
settings-general-telemetry-description = Send crash and error diagnostics to help improve reliability.
settings-general-privacy-policy = Privacy Policy
settings-general-discord-presence-label = Discord Rich Presence
settings-general-discord-presence-description = Show your current game and status on Discord.

settings-general-performance-title = Performance
settings-general-performance-subheader = Optimization settings for game performance.
settings-general-dedicated-gpu-label = Use Dedicated GPU
settings-general-dedicated-gpu-description = Attempt to force Minecraft to use your high-performance graphics card (NVIDIA/AMD).

settings-general-resources-title = Resources
settings-general-auto-install-deps-label = Automatically Install Dependencies
settings-general-auto-install-deps-description = Automatically download and install required mods and engines when adding a new resource.
settings-general-parallel-downloads-label = Parallel Download Threads
settings-general-parallel-downloads-description = Number of simultaneous downloads when installing resources.

settings-general-storage-title = Storage
settings-general-artifact-cache-label = Artifact Cache Limit
settings-general-artifact-cache-description = Controls the size of the installer artifact and modpack archive cache.
settings-general-cache-limit-unit = MB

settings-general-network-proxy-title = Network / Proxy
settings-general-network-proxy-subheader = Route launcher-managed HTTP traffic through a proxy.
settings-general-use-proxy-label = Use Proxy
settings-general-use-proxy-description = Apply a proxy to launcher HTTP traffic after restart.
settings-general-proxy-restart-note = Restart required. Saved changes apply to regular launcher traffic after restart. You can keep editing and test the proxy first.
settings-general-proxy-url-label = Proxy URL
settings-general-proxy-url-description = Supports http://, https://, socks5://, and socks5h://. HTTPS inspection requires a trusted proxy CA.
settings-general-proxy-credentials-note = Proxy credentials in URLs are saved in launcher config. Use them only on trusted devices.
settings-general-proxy-test = Test Proxy
settings-general-proxy-testing = Testing…
settings-general-proxy-connected = Proxy connected
settings-general-proxy-connection-failed = Proxy connection failed
settings-general-proxy-connected-description = Launcher traffic can use this proxy after restart.
settings-general-proxy-connection-failed-description = Check the proxy settings row or logs for details.
settings-general-proxy-apply-to-games-label = Use For Launched Games
settings-general-proxy-apply-to-games-description = Pass proxy host and port to Minecraft as JVM arguments. Credentials are not passed to the game process.

settings-general-system-tray-title = System Tray
settings-general-autostart-label = Launch On System Startup
settings-general-autostart-description = Start Vesta Launcher automatically when you sign in.
settings-general-show-tray-icon-label = Show Tray Icon
settings-general-show-tray-icon-description = Display the launcher icon in the system tray.
settings-general-close-to-tray-label = Close Button Hides To Tray
settings-general-close-to-tray-description = When enabled, clicking the window close button hides the launcher to tray instead of requesting app exit.
